sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as Dashboard SPA
    participant API as Analytics API
    participant CA as Cache
    participant DK as DuckDB Hot
    participant PQ as Parquet Cold
    participant EX as Export / Report Layer

    UI->>API: GET /api/analytics/* with site, date, filters
    API->>CA: Lookup cache key

    alt cache hit
        CA-->>API: Cached JSON payload
    else cache miss
        API->>DK: Query recent hot window
        alt range crosses hot boundary
            API->>PQ: Read historical parquet partitions
            DK-->>API: Recent rows / aggregates
            PQ-->>API: Historical rows / aggregates
            API->>API: UNION ALL + latest-record window logic
        else hot-only request
            DK-->>API: Full result from hot tables
        end
        API->>CA: Store response with route TTL
    end

    API-->>UI: Metrics, charts, tables
    UI->>API: Export CSV / report request
    API->>EX: Build export from hot + cold result set
    EX-->>UI: Download stream / file URL
